[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14043.87, "timestamp": "03:54:03", "text": "我把行李箱当桌子用。啊，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14047.99, "timestamp": "03:54:07", "text": "那种很精致的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14051.349, "timestamp": "03:54:11", "text": "是的，这个就像一个电容式麦克风。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14052.91, "timestamp": "03:54:12", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14056.15, "timestamp": "03:54:16", "text": "好的。这台笔记本电脑看起来像全新的一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14059.67, "timestamp": "03:54:19", "text": "那台笔记本电脑坏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14061.51, "timestamp": "03:54:21", "text": "我的意思是，那是我买的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14075.269, "timestamp": "03:54:35", "text": "我的意思是，你还能指望什么呢？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14077.429, "timestamp": "03:54:37", "text": "简直就像在跑鹰眼之星一样"}]